    "d": 1213,
    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "Bliss-rock at the front gives way for more assertive, rocking play before a series of modulations begins a push and pull between major and minor key tonalities. Settling towards a funky rock zone, the band finds stability and turns the jam into am ebullient, funk-rock rave-up with a smidge of space-y ooze along the edges. This then drives towards a verve-filled peak rock section before concluding with \"SYSF's\" closing chorus."
     }
    ]
   },
